return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T02:24:24+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T02:24:24+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Maboyar shafi da kuma maboyar kayan aiki ta Redis don kowane shafin WordPress. Yana amfani da maboyar uwar garken LiteSpeed inda take, da kuma maboyar diski tasa a duk sauran wurare, yana goge abin da canji ya shafa kawai, kuma yana tabbatar da cewa haɗin Redis yana aiki.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Cache','Page cache'=>'Wurin ajiye shafi','Object cache'=>'Wurin adana abubuwa na ɗan lokaci','Purging'=>'Ana sharewa','Exclusions'=>'Keɓancewa','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakilan AI (MCP)','Purge everything now'=>'Share komai yanzu','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Ana watsar da kowane shafi da aka ajiye a ma\'adanar kache kuma za a sake gina shi yayin da maziyarta ke shigowa. A ci gaba?','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ba wakilan AI izini (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'A kashe: kayan aikin da ke ƙasa da hanyoyin REST ɗinsu ba a yi musu rajista ko kaɗan ba.','Full-page cache'=>'Cache na cikakken shafi','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'A kan uwar garken LiteSpeed, uwar garken yanar gizo ce ke bayar da shafuka kafin WordPress ya yi aiki. A kan kowace uwar garke dabam, wannan manhaja tana adana kowane shafi a matsayin fayil kuma tana bayar da shi kafin WordPress ya loda. Daga nan ne kusan dukkan saurin yake fitowa.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Adana shafuka a ma\'ajiya don maziyartan da ba su shiga ciki ba','How long a page stays cached'=>'Tsawon lokacin da shafi zai ci gaba da kasancewa a ma\'aji','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Daƙiƙoƙi. Mako ɗaya ya dace da yawancin shafuka; shafin labarai da ke wallafawa kowane sa\'a yana buƙatar ƙasa da haka sosai.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Tsawon lokacin da burauzar mai ziyara ke ajiye hotuna da rubutun umarni','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Daƙiƙoƙi. Ya shafi hotuna, CSS da JavaScript kawai — ba zai taɓa shafi shafuka ba. Saita zuwa 0 don barin wannan ga mai masaukin ku.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Baƙin da suka shiga','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Kada a taɓa bayar da shafin da aka adana a ma\'aji ga maziyarcen da ya shiga ciki','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'Kunna shi ne amsa mai aminci kuma zabin asali. Kashe shi kawai idan ka san kowane shafi da aka adana iri daya ne ga kowane mai amfani da ya shiga — shafin mambobi shine dalilin da aka saba da shi na rashin yin hakan.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Tsawon rayuwa daban-daban don abun ciki daban-daban','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Misali: shafukan samfuran shago na tsawon awa ɗaya, yayin da sauran komai ke zama na mako guda.','Add a rule'=>'Ƙara ƙa\'ida','Content type'=>'Nau\'in abun ciki','Seconds'=>'Dakiku','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Wurin ajiya na abu (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Mai masaukin ku yana gudanar da ma\'ajiyar abubuwa ta Redis ta sirri don wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma yana kiyaye shi a daidaita. Babu wani abu da za a saita a nan; matsayin da ke saman wannan allon yana nuna ko yana aiki.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Yana adana sakamakon tambayoyin rumbun bayanai a ma\'ajiyar ɗan-lokaci. Yana taimakawa sosai a kan shagon da ke da cunkoso ko rukunin yanar gizo mai yawan zirga-zirgar masu shiga, inda ma\'ajiyar shafi ba za ta iya taimakawa ba.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Shigar da drop-in na ma\'ajiyar abubuwa na Redis','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Yana buƙatar ƙarin phpredis. Idan babu shi, akwatin da ke saman wannan allon yana nuna haka.','Redis host'=>'Mai masaukin baki na Redis','Redis port'=>'Tashar Redis','Redis database'=>'Rumbun adana bayanai na Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Bawa kowane shafi a kan Redis mai haɗin gwiwa lambar kansa, in ba haka ba za su goge ma\'ajiyar cache ta juna.','Redis username'=>'Sunan mai amfani na Redis','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Don sabar Redis kawai tare da masu amfani da ACL (Redis 6 ko kuma na gaba). Bar shi a banza don shiga da kalmar sirri kawai.','Redis password'=>'Kalmar sirri ta Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Bar shi a sarari idan Redis ɗinka baya buƙata.','Key prefix'=>'Haruffan farko na kewayawa','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Wata hanya daban ga lambar rumbun adana bayanai ta daban lokacin da ba za ku iya samun ɗaya ba.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Goge ta atomatik mai basira','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Share shafukan da abin ya shafa ta atomatik lokacin da abun ciki ya canza','After updates'=>'Bayan sabuntawa','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Share komai bayan sabunta tushe, manhaja ko jigo','After a comment'=>'Bayan sharhi','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Share shafin rubutu idan an amince da sharhi a kansa','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Kashe wannan a sashin sharhi mai yawan aiki sosai, inda zai iya share shafi ɗaya sau ɗaruruwa a cikin sa\'a ɗaya.','Never cache these'=>'Kada a taɓa ajiye waɗannan a ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Kullum ana amfani da tsoffin saitunan WordPress da WooCommerce masu ma\'ana — cart, checkout, my-account da kowane zama da aka shiga ba a taba ajiye su a cache ba, ko ma me ke ƙasa.','Addresses'=>'Adiresoshi','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Hanya ɗaya a kowane layi, misali <code>/basket</code>. Alamar <code>*</code> a ƙarshe tana dacewa da duk abin da ke ƙarƙashinsa.','Query parameters'=>'Siffofin tambaya','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Shafin da ke ɗauke da ɗayan waɗannan ba a taɓa ajiye shi a cache ba — misali alamar samfoti ta sau ɗaya.','Cookies'=>'Kukis','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Maziyarcin da ke ɗauke da ɗayan waɗannan ana buɗe masa sabon shafi a kowane lokaci.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'An jefar da kowane shafi da aka ajiye a ma\'ajiya. Za a sake gina su yayin da maziyarta suka iso.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'An shigar da ma\'ajiyar abubuwa ta wucin gadi, amma ba ya ajiye komai.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Ma\'ajiyar shafi na kunne, amma har yanzu ba a adana shafukan ba.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress bai loda drop-in na ma\'ajiyar shafi (page-cache) ba tukunna. Zai fara aiki a lodi na shafi na gaba; idan bai fara ba, duba ko an saita WP_CACHE zuwa true a cikin wp-config.php.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Wurin adana abubuwa na ɗan lokaci (object cache) yana kunne, amma wannan uwar garken ba ta da goyon bayan Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Ba a shigar da ƙarin phpredis ba, don haka ba za a iya amfani da drop-in ɗin ba kuma WordPress yana komawa zuwa ma\'adanar cache na ƙwaƙwalwarsa kanta. Nemi mai masaukin ku ya kunna phpredis.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Ba a kache komai ba.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Dukkan ɓoyayyun bayanan (caches) a kashe suke, don haka wannan manhaja ba ta sa shafin ya fi sauri ba.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Ana amfani da ɓoyayyen ma\'aji a wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis ya ƙi sunan mai amfani ko kalmar sirri. Duba bayanan shiga na Redis a cikin wp-config.php ko a wannan allon.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis ya karɓi shigar amma baya barin wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya adana maɓallansa. Mai amfani da Redis yana buƙatar izini don prefix ɗin maɓallin wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis ya ƙi lambar rumbun adana bayanai. Bincika saitin rumbun adana bayanai na Redis.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis ya cika, ba shi da sauran wurin ajiya, kuma yana ƙin karɓar sabbin bayanai.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Ba a shigar da ƙarin phpredis ba, don haka WordPress tana amfani da nata ma\'ajiyar ciki ta memory. Nemi mai masaukin gidan yanar gizonku ya kunna phpredis.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'An saita WP_REDIS_DISABLED a cikin wp-config.php, don haka an kashe ma\'ajiyar abubuwa.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Ba a iya samun uwar garken Redis ba. Bincika mai masaukin baki da tashar jiragen ruwa na Redis, sannan a tabbata Redis na aiki.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis bai dawo da ƙimar da aka rubuta masa yanzu ba. Bincika bayanan uwar garken Redis.','Web server'=>'Safar gidan yanar gizo','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — sabar gidan yanar gizo ce ke adana shafuka a ma\'ajiya','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'Ba LiteSpeed ba ne — ana adana shafuka a kan diski ta wannan manhajar','Pages stored on disk'=>'Shafukan da aka adana a diski','Redis support'=>'Goyan bayan Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'An shigar da phpredis','phpredis is not installed'=>'Ba a shigar da phpredis ba','Page lifetime'=>'Tsawon ran shafi','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin share ma\'ajiyar ɓoye (cache) ba.','Cache purge requested.'=>'An nemi share ma\'ajiyar cache.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: an shigar da wani object-cache drop-in ɗin, saboda haka wannan manhajar ba ta kula da ma\'ajiyar abubuwa ta Redis.','detected'=>'An gano','not detected'=>'Ba a gano ba','phpredis extension missing'=>'Ƙarin phpredis ya ɓace','installed, not storing anything'=>'an girka, ba ya ajiye komai','active, managed by your host'=>'yana aiki, wanda mai masaukin ku ke sarrafawa','active'=>'Mai aiki','inactive'=>'Mara aiki','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Wurin ajiya na LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Wurin ajiye abubuwa na Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Tsarar Redis PHP (phpredis) ba ta samuwa a kan wannan uwar garken, saboda haka ba za a iya kunna ma\'ajiyar abubuwa ba.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'An riga an shigar da wani drop-in na object-cache daban. Cire shi kafin kunna ma\'ajiyar abubuwa ta Zinn®.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta fayil ɗin daidaita haɗin Redis ba.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta drop-in ɗin object-cache da aka haɗa ba.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Ba a iya shigar da drop-in na object-cache a cikin wp-content ba.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Ba a iya cire drop-in na object-cache ba.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Ba za a iya rubutawa a tsarin fayil na WordPress ba, don haka ba a iya sarrafa abin da ake amfani da shi na object-cache ba.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Wani manhajar ƙarin shafi na ma\'ajiyar cache ya shigar da wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Cire waccan manhajar da farko, ko ci gaba da amfani da ma\'ajiyar cache ɗin ta.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta babban fayil ɗin wp-content/cache/zinn-cache ba, don haka ba za a iya ajiye shafuka a rumbun ajiya ba.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta wp-content/advanced-cache.php ba, don haka ba za a iya ajiye shafuka a ma\'ajiya ba.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukewa ba don wannan sabuntawar. Duba don tabbatar da cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon na iya isa ga dandalin Zinn®, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawa daga sabis na sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s) ba. Sake gwadawa nan da \'yan mintuna.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka saukar ta gaza a gwajin ingancinta kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.','Go Pro'=>'Koma Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Allon nazarin cache: adadin nasara, ƙwaƙwalwa, maɓallai da umarnin cache mafi jinkiri.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Wani mai nemo tambayoyi masu jinkiri da kiran da ba a ajiye a cache ba wanda ke bayyana ƙari ko jigon da ke da alhakin.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Wani matakin APCu na cikin ƙwaƙwalwa (in-memory) a gaban Redis don maɓallan da aka fi amfani da su, tare da ɗauko bayanai tun da wuri (prefetching), matse bayanai (compression) da kuma mai tsara bayanai na igbinary.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Kwashe cache bisa alamomi (tags) don rubuce-rubuce, kalmomi, da kayayyakin WooCommerce, ta yadda abin da ya canza kawai ake sharewa, tare da kwashe cache na shafi da na abubuwa (objects) a lokaci guda.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Dumin ma\'aji ta atomatik bayan kwashewa, hotunan WebP da AVIF, cire CSS da ba a yi amfani da shi ba da kuma jinkirta JavaScript.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Tsara tsabtace rumbun adana bayanai tare da samfotin gani, da ka\'idojin ma\'ajiyar kache ta kowane shafi.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Faɗakarwar lafiyar cache a cikin dashboard ɗinku na Zinn Digital® lokacin da rabon nasarar samu (hit ratio) ya faɗi ko ƙwaƙwalwa ta cika.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Kowane abu a kan sauran shafukan kyauta ne kuma zai ci gaba da kasancewa kyauta. Pro yana girkuwa ne a saman wannan manhajar sannan yana ƙara:','See what Pro costs'=>'Duba kudin Pro','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Kowane shiri yana farawa ne da gwajin kyauta na kwanaki 14, babu bukatar katin kuɗi: %1$s a shekara don shafi ɗaya, %2$s don shafuka biyar, %3$s don shafuka marasa iyaka.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'Ba a sami wp-config.php ba, don haka ba a iya kunna WP_CACHE ba. Ƙara define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); a ciki.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php ya riga ya ayyana WP_CACHE a matsayin false, saboda haka ma\'ajiyar shafi ba za ta iya farawa ba. Canza shi zuwa true.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'Ba za a iya rubuta wp-config.php ba, saboda haka ba a iya kunna WP_CACHE ba. Ƙara define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); a ciki.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana. Rubuta sabon kima domin maye gurbinsa.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jeri…','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jeri','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matatar.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara layi','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan layin','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani','Overview'=>'Bayani na gaba ɗaya','Copied'=>'An kwafa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane manhajar Zinn® a kan wannan shafi, da kuma ko tana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ba a buƙatar haɗi don wannan plugin ɗin ba.','Open settings'=>'Bude saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ku da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sassan saituna','Support'=>'Taimako','Save changes'=>'Ajiye sauye-sauye','Tools'=>'Kayan aiki','Export settings'=>'Fitar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake saita zuwa na asali','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai mayar da kowane saiti a wannan manhaja zuwa na asali. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken gano matsala don tallafi','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saituna','Import'=>'Shigo da','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa taɓa ƙunshi kalmomin sirri, alamu ko maɓallan API — za ku buƙaci sake shigar da su a sabon rukunin yanar gizon.','Settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saituna.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kowane saiti a kan wannan manhaja an mayar da shi zuwa asali.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Wannan aikin ba ya samuwa.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga manhajar Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ya yi girma da yawa da zai zama fitarwar saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwar saitunan Zinn® ba ne.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil daga wani daban toshe (%s), don haka shigar da shi a nan zai adana saitunan da wannan toshe ba ya fahimta.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saitin %d. Ba a taɓa haɗa kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna guda %d. Ba a taɓa haɗa kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin abin da aka fitar, don haka sake shigar da su.','Connected'=>'An Haɗa','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma akwai abin da ke buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Yana aiki a kan asusunka na kanka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya duba wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan manhaja ba ta faɗi dalili ba. Aika rahoton binciken matsala kuma za mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Duba na ƙarshe %s da suka wuce.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana budewa a sabon shafi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan zuwa tallafin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan shi ne ainihin abin da za a aika — babu wani abu kuma babu wani abin da aka ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrinku, alamomin shaida (tokens) da maɓallan API ɗinku ba sa ciki.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton gwajin da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafi zuwa allon kili-kwafi','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan rahoton zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Muna buɗe muku tikitin taimako kuma muna ba da amsa ta imel. Idan ba kwa son aikawa, kwafi shi a sama sannan ku liƙa shi da kanku a cikin tikiti.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® daga wannan sabar (%s) ba. Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti a maimakon haka — babu wani abu da ba daidai ba a saitunanku.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Sashen tallafi na Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Sashen tallafi na Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lamba %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Kun aika rahotanni da yawa a cikin kankanin lokaci. Jira na \'yan mintuna ka sake gwadawa — na farkon sun isa.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ba ta iya karɓar rahoton ba a yanzu — matsalar daga ɓangarenmu take, ba daga naku ba. Sake gwadawa an jima kaɗan, ko kuma ku kwafi rahoton da ke sama zuwa tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi karɓar rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton lambar.','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Abokin cinikin hosting ne? Samu rangwamen %1$d%% a kan %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'A matsayin abokin cinikin karɓar baƙuncin Zinn Digital®, kuna samun lambar sirri don rangwamen %d%% a kan biyan kuɗinku na farko. Sabuntawa yana kan farashin yau da kullun.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Sami lambar %d%% dina kuma ci gaba zuwa biya','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi haƙuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Wannan rangwamen na abokan ciniki ne da ke da tsarin ɗaukar nauyin shafi da aka biya mai aiki lafiya. Gwajin kyauta ba ya cancanta.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Kun riga kun yi amfani da rangwamen abokin ciniki na karɓar baƙuncin yanar gizo don wannan manhajar ƙari.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya samun lambar ku a yanzu ba. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da \'yan mintuna.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani da %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Bakuncin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, ajiyayyun bayanan yau da kullum, canja wurin bayani kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke kula da shafuka fiye da daya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi da sayar da kafaffun shafukan yanar gizo, yankuna (domains) da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi (link placements), tare da ajiye kuɗin lafiya har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki ma\'aikatan da wannan shi ne sana\'arsu','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta masu zaman kansu ta duniya: bincika sama da ayyuka 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya aiki kuma bari su ba da tayi.','Style preset'=>'Saitin salon da aka riga aka saita','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Matsayin farawa. Duk wani abu a ƙasa yana maye gurbinsa.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmana na kaina','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma za a yi amfani da saitin yadda yake daidai.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'mabuɗin lasisi','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Ba a riga an haɗa mai amfani da lasisin ba, wanda ke da mahimmanci don hana kunnawa ba tare da izini ba. Don sanya lasisin ga mai amfani da ku, kun yarda ku raba cikakken suna da adireshin imel na mai amfani da WordPress ɗinku.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'shafukan da aka ambata a sama','Account'=>'Asusu','Account Details'=>'Bayanin Asusun','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Asusun yana jiran kunnawa. Da fatan za a duba imel ɗinku kuma ku danna mahaɗin don kunna asusunku sannan ku sake ƙaddamar da fom ɗin haɗin gwiwa.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Kuna so ku haɗa %1$s zuwa cikin %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ayyuka','Activate'=>'Kunna','Activate Free Version'=>'Kunna Sigar Kyauta','Activate License'=>'Kunna Lasisi','activate a license here'=>'Kunna lasisi a nan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Da fatan za a shigar da makullin lasisin da kuka karɓa a imel nan da nan bayan siyan:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Kunna lasisi a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kunna lasisi a kan duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' An riga an shigar da sigar biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a kunna ta don fara cin gajiyar abubuwan %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' An riga an shigar da sigar biya ta %1$s. Da fatan za a je zuwa %2$s don kunna ta kuma fara cin gajiyar abubuwan %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kunna wannan ƙari','Activate %s'=>'Kunna %s','Activate %s features'=>'Kunna fasalolin %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kammala Kunna "%s" Yanzu','Activate %s Plan'=>'Kunna Tsarin %s','Activated'=>'An kunna','Activating'=>'Ana kunnawa','Activating license'=>'Ana kunna lasisi','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'An yi nasarar kunna asusunka tare da tsarin %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Mai aiki','Add another domain'=>'Ƙara wani yankin','Add-Ons'=>'Karin Abubuwa','Add Ons for %s'=>'Karin Abubuwa domin %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya loda jerin ƙarin abubuwan ba. Wataƙila matsalar daga gare mu ce, da fatan za a sake dawowa bayan \'yan mintuna.','Add-On'=>'Ƙari','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ƙari ne na musamman na masu biya kawai. Dole ne ku fara siyan lasisi kafin kunna manhajar.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'An yi nasarar siyan ƙarin %s.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'An yi nasarar haɓaka tsarin ƙarin %s naka.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'An yi nasarar soke gwajin kyauta na %s. Tun da ƙarin na musamman ne (premium) kawai, an kashe shi kai tsaye. Idan kuna son amfani da shi a gaba, dole ne ku sayi lasisi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ba zai iya aiki ba tare da toshe-shafi ba.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ba zai iya aiki ba tare da %2$s ba.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kawai muna sanar da ku cewa ana ɗauko bayanin ƙarin kayan aikin %s daga wata uwar garken waje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Karin bayani na manhaja ta %s','Address'=>'Adireshin','Address Line %d'=>'Layin Adireshi %d','Affiliate'=>'Abokin Haɗin Gwiwa','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sakamakon keta ka\'idojin haɗin gwiwarmu, mun yanke shawarar dakatar da asusunka na haɗin gwiwa na ɗan lokaci. Idan kana da wata tambaya, tuntuɓi sashen tallafi.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'An dakatar da asusunka na haɗin gwiwa na ɗan lokaci.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'An karɓi aikace-aikacen haɗin gwiwarku na %1$s! Shiga sashin haɗin gwiwarku a: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Mun gode da neman shiga shirinmu na haɗin gwiwa, abin takaici, a wannan lokacin mun yanke shawarar ƙin amincewa da buƙatarku. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da kwanaki 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Mun gode da neman shiga shirinmu na haɗin gwiwa, za mu duba bayananku a cikin kwanaki 14 masu zuwa kuma za mu tuntuɓe ku da ƙarin bayani.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'Kukis mai bibiya ta %s bayan ziyara ta farko don haɓaka damar samun kuɗi.','Affiliation'=>'Haɗin gwiwa','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare har yanzu kuna iya amfani da sigar Kyauta amma BA za ku sami damar yin amfani da fasalolin %s ba.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare, ba za ku ƙara iya amfani da %s ba, sai dai idan kun sake kunna shi da ingantaccen lasisin ƙima.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Kuna iya ci gaba da amfani da duk fasalullukan %1$s amma ba za ku sami damar samun sabuntawar tsaro da fasalulluka na %2$s ba, ko kuma tallafi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Na gode da haɓakawa.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bayan %1$s ɗinku na kyauta, biya mafi ƙanƙanta kamar %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Yarda & Kunna Lasisi','I Agree - Change User'=>'Na yarda - Sauya mai amfani','All Requests'=>'Duk Buƙatun','All Types'=>'Duk Nau\'o\'i','allow'=>'Ba da izini','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Kun riga kun shiga cikin bin diddigin amfani da mu, wanda ke taimaka mana ci gaba da inganta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Kun riga kun shiga cikin bin diddigin amfaninmu, wanda ke taimaka mana ci gaba da inganta su.','Amount'=>'Adadi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Na shekara','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kowace shekara','Anonymous feedback'=>'Ra\'ayin da ba a san mai shi ba','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Aiwatar a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Aiwatar a duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Nemi shiga don zama abokin haɗin gwiwa','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Amince & Fara Gwaji','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Da fatan za a gaya mana dalili domin mu sami damar ingantawa.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel ɗin da kuka yi amfani da shi don haɓakawa a ƙasa kuma za mu sake aiko muku da maɓallin lasisin.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel ɗin da kuka yi amfani da shi lokacin sayayya kuma za mu sake aiko muku da maɓallin lasisi.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Haɗa da asusun mai lasisi.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Marubuci','Invalid module ID.'=>'ID ɗin manhaja mara inganci.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ba ku da ingantaccen lasisi don samun damar shiga sigar ƙima.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Shigarwa ta atomatik tana aiki ne kawai ga masu amfani da suka amince.','Premium version already active.'=>'Tuni an kunna sigar Premium.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar ƙarin ƙima.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Wannan manhaja "Serviceware" ce, ma\'ana ba ta da sigar lamba ta musamman (premium).','Automatic Installation'=>'Girkawa ta atomatik','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kashewa da kanta nan da:','Average Rating'=>'Matsakaicin Ƙima','Awesome'=>'Mai ban mamaki','based on %s'=>'bisa ga %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Zama abokin hulɗa','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Kuna son %s? Ku zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kudi ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Sannu, ko ka san cewa %1$s yana da shirin haɗin gwiwa (affiliate program)? Idan kana son %2$s za ka iya zama jakadanmu kuma ka sami kuɗi!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Mafi kyau','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Ɗaukaka zuwa fasalin Beta zai musanya fasalin %s da kuka girka da sabon fasalin Beta - ku yi amfani da shi cikin taka tsantsan, kuma kada ku yi amfani da shi a kan shafukan aiki na zahiri. An riga an gargaɗe ku.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An yi lissafin kudi %s','Billing'=>'Biya','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biya & Daftari','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An toshe','Blocking'=>'Ana Tareshewa','Blog ID'=>'ID na Blog','Body'=>'Gangar jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ee - duka adiresoshin nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Kundi','Bundle Plan'=>'Tsarin Kunshiya','Business name'=>'Sunan kasuwanci','Buy license'=>'Sayi lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi yanzu','Cancel'=>'Soke','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biyan Kuɗi','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba ka da shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ko wani rukunin daban) - ko za ka so a soke %2$s ɗin ma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwajin zai toshe damar yin amfani da duk abubuwan ƙima nan take. Ka tabbata?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Ana soke rajista','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za ka iya samun maɓallin lasisinka ba?','Change License'=>'Sauya Lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An aika da imel na tabbatarwa zuwa ga %s. Dole ne ku tabbatar da sabuntawar a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba za ku iya samun imel ɗin ba, da fatan za a bincika babban fayil ɗin spam ɗinku.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'An aika da imel ɗin tabbatarwa zuwa %s yanzu. Dole ne mai imel ɗin ya tabbatar da sabuntawar a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s ne sabon mai asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Mun gode da tabbatar da sauyin mallakar. Yanzu aka aika imel zuwa %s don amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Sauya Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Sauya Tsari','Change User'=>'Sauya Mai amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar sauya mai amfani, kun yarda da sauya ikon mallakar asusun zuwa:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Rikodin Canje-canje','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana sauya mai amfani, da fatan a jira','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Idan ba ku sami imel ɗin ba, gwada duba babban fayil ɗin saƙon takarce (spam) ko bincika imel daga %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Biya kuɗi','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Zaɓi har zuwa shafi/shafuka %s don kunna lasisin a kai.','City'=>'Gari','Clear API Cache'=>'Share Ma\'ajiyar API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Share Bayanan Wucin Gadi na Sabuntawa','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Danna nan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Danna nan don amfani da manhajar ba tare da bayyana suna ba','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Danna don ganin bita-bita da suka bayar da ƙimar %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s adireshin imel na abokin cinikina ne','Code'=>'Lambar sirri','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kwamishina na %s lokacin da abokin ciniki ya sayi sabon lasisi.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kamar yadda muke ajiye kwanaki 30 don yiwuwar mayar da kuɗi, muna biyan kwamishononi da suka wuce kwanaki 30 ne kawai.','Communication'=>'Sadarwa','Compatible up to'=>'Mai jituwa har zuwa','complete the opt-in'=>'Kammala shiga ciki','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Taya murna','Never miss an important update'=>'Kada ka taɓa rasa muhimmin sabuntawa','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Mun gode da sabuntawa zuwa %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Shiga don samun sanarwar imel game da sabunta tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimantarwa, da tayi na lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu bayanan asali na muhallin WordPress. Wannan zai taimaka mana mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizon ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙata.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Shiga ciki domin samun sanarwar imel don sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimantarwa, da tayi na lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu muhimman bayanan muhallin WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, ba matsala! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki lafiya kalau.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓin shiga domin kada ku rasa wani muhimmin sabuntawa kuma ku taimaka mana mu sa %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizonku da kuma yin abin da kuke buƙata da kyau.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna farin cikin gabatar da haɗin gwiwar matakin cibiyar sadarwa na Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'A lokacin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafi/shafuka %s a cikin hanyar sadarwar da ke jiran kulawarku har yanzu.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'A lokacin aikin sabuntawa mun gano rukunin yanar gizo %d da ke jiran kunna lasisi har yanzu.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kuna son amfani da %s a kan waɗancan shafukan, da fatan za a shigar da maɓallin lasisin ku a ƙasa kuma ku danna maɓallin kunnawa.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, za ku iya tsallake shi a yanzu kuma ku kunna lasisin daga baya, a cikin shafin Asusun matakin hanyar sadarwa na %s.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'An haɗa','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar ka gama, kashe %s sannan ka sake kunna shi.','Contact'=>'Tuntuɓi','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Da fatan za a sanar da mu idan kuna son mu tuntuɓe ku don sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da kuma tayin lokaci-lokaci:','Contact Support'=>'Tuntuɓi Tallafi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Kuyi hakuri da rashin dacewar kuma muna nan don taimaka muku idan kuka bamu dama.','Contact Us'=>'Tuntube Mu','Please contact us here'=>'Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu a nan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu da saƙo mai zuwa:','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Contributors'=>'Masu Ba da Gudunmawa','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Ba a iya kunna %s ba.','Country'=>'Ƙasa','Cron Type'=>'Nau\'in Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Muna amfani da dakin karatu na PHP cURL don kiran API, wanda dakin karatu ne da aka saba amfani da shi kuma yawanci an riga an shigar da shi kuma an kunna shi. Abin takaici, ba a kunna cURL ba (ko an kashe shi) a uwar garkenku.','data'=>'Bayanai','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'An yi nasarar kunna yanayin gyara kuskure kuma za a kashe shi ta atomatik nan da minti 60. Hakanan zaku iya kashe shi da wuri ta danna mahadar "Stop Debug".','Date'=>'Kwanan wata','Deactivate'=>'Kashe','Deactivate the free version'=>'Kashe sigar kyauta','Deactivate License'=>'Kashe Lasisi','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Kasshe lasisinku zai toshe dukkan fasalolin biyan kuɗi, amma zai ba da damar kunna lasisin a wani shafin daban. Kun tabbata kuna son ci gaba?','Deactivation'=>'Kashewa','Yes - %s'=>'Eh - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Aika da %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kashewa ko cire %s zai kashe lasisin kai tsaye, wanda za ku iya amfani da shi a wani shafin.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Idan kana da ɗan lokaci, da fatan za ka sanar da mu dalilin da ya sa kake %s','Debug Log'=>'Kundin Binciken Kura-kurai','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Gyaran kuskure','delegate'=>'Wakilta','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Idan ka danna shi, za a tura wannan shawarar zuwa ga masu kula da shafukan.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Wakilta wa Masu Kula da Shafin','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Ba wa Masu Kula da Shafin Iko kuma Ci Gaba','Delegating, please wait'=>'Ana wakiltawa, da fatan za a jira','verbDelete'=>'Goge','Delete All Accounts'=>'Goge Duk Asusu','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Shin kun tabbata kuna son share duk bayanan Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Kwatance','Details'=>'Cikakkun bayanai','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our records.'=>'Kamar makullin da ka shigar bai dace da bayananmu ba.','Diagnostic Info'=>'Bayanin Binciken Matsala','Disabling white-label mode'=>'Ana kashe yanayin farar alama','Disconnect'=>'Cire haɗi','Are you sure you would like to proceed with the disconnection?'=>'Ka tabbata kana son ci gaba da cire haɗin?','If you wish to cancel your %1$s plan\'s subscription instead, please navigate to the %2$s and cancel it there.'=>'Idan kana son soke biyan kuɗin tsarin %1$s naka a maimakon haka, da fatan za a kewaya zuwa %2$s kuma ka soke shi a can.','as close a windowDismiss'=>'Watsar','do %1$sNOT%2$s send me security & feature updates, educational content and offers.'=>'%1$sKADA%2$s a aiko mini da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimantarwa da kuma tayi.','Enter the domain of your website or other websites from where you plan to promote the %s.'=>'Shigar da yankin rukunin yanar gizon ku ko wasu rukunin yanar gizo daga inda kuke shirin tallata %s.','Where are you going to promote the %s?'=>'A ina za ku tallata %s?','Domain is required.'=>'Ana buƙatar yanki.','Donate to this plugin'=>'Ba da gudummawa ga wannan plugin ɗin','Done'=>'An kammala','Don\'t cancel %s - I\'m still interested in getting security & feature updates, as well as be able to contact support.'=>'Kada a soke %s - Har yanzu ina da sha\'awar samun sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, gami da samun damar tuntuɓar tallafi.','Don\'t have a license key?'=>'Ba ku da maɓallin lasisi?','You might have missed it, but you don\'t have to share any data and can just %s the opt-in.'=>'Wataƙila ka rasa shi, amma ba lallai ba ne ka raba kowane bayani kuma za ka iya kawai %s shiga ciki.','verbDowngrade'=>'Rage daraja','%1$s will immediately stop all future recurring payments and your %2$s plan license will expire in %3$s.'=>'%1$s zai dakatar da duk biyan kuɗi na gaba nan take kuma lasisin tsarin %2$s naku zai ƙare a cikin %3$s.','Downgrading'=>'Ana ragewa','Downgrading your plan'=>'Sauke shirin ku zuwa na ƙasa','Download'=>'Sauke','as download latest versionDownload Latest'=>'Sauke Na Baya-bayan nan','as download latest versionDownload Latest Free Version'=>'Sauke Sabon Sigar Kyauta','Download the latest version'=>'Sauke sabon juyi','Download the latest %s version'=>'Sauke sabon salo na %s','Download Paid Version'=>'Sauke Sigar da Aka Biya','Download %s Version'=>'Zazzage Sigar %s','Downloaded'=>'An sauke','Due to the new %1$sEU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)%2$s compliance requirements it is required that you provide your explicit consent, again, confirming that you are onboard :-)'=>'Sakamakon sabbin ka\'idojin bin doka na %1$sEU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)%2$s, ana buƙatar ka sake ba da cikakkiyar yardarka, tare da tabbatar da cewa kana tare da mu :-)','Duplicate Website'=>'Kwafi Yanar Gizo','verbEdit'=>'Gyara','Email'=>'Imel','Email address'=>'Adireshin imel','Email address is required.'=>'Ana buƙatar adireshin imel.','%s is my email address'=>'%s adireshin imel dina ne','Email address update'=>'Sabunta adireshin imel','Are both %1$s and %2$s your email addresses?'=>'Shin duka %1$s da %2$s adiresoshin imel ɗinku ne?','We couldn\'t find your email address in the system, are you sure it\'s the right address?'=>'Ba mu sami adireshin imel ɗinku a cikin tsarin ba, shin kun tabbata shi ne daidai adireshin?','Your email has been successfully verified - you are AWESOME!'=>'An yi nasarar t