 da kuma guje wa rikici tare da manhajoji da jigogin da kuka shigar.','Trial'=>'Gwajin gwaji','View %s State'=>'Duba Halin %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Duba Muhimman Bayanan %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ee, %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s don manufar gwaji, saiti (staging), ko haɓakawa.','You have a %s license.'=>'Kuna da lasisin %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Kun sayi lasisin %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Ya kamata ka karɓi imel ɗin tabbatarwa don %1$s a cikin akwatin saƙonka a %2$s. Da fatan za a tabbatar ka danna maballin da ke cikin wannan imel ɗin don %3$s.','days'=>'kwanaki','deactivating'=>'Ana kashewa','hour'=>'awa','hours'=>'awanni','license'=>'Lasisi','optional'=>'na zaɓi','products'=>'Kayan aiki','skip'=>'Tsallake','subscription'=>'Biyan kuɗi','trial'=>'Gwajin Gwaji','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Kayan aiki','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ana kunnawa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Lasisi','close a windowDismiss'=>'Yi watsi','close windowDismiss'=>'Yi watsi da shi','like websitesSites'=>'Shafuka','nounPricing'=>'Farashi','trial periodTrial'=>'Gwajin kyauta','verbOpt In'=>'Shiga ciki','verbOpt Out'=>'Fice daga ciki','verbSkip'=>'Tsallake','verbUpgrade'=>'Haɓaka','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s da suka wuce','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Ba a iya kammala aikin ba. Sake gwadawa, kuma idan ya ci gaba da faduwa, tuntuɓi mai kula da shafin.','Connect an AI app'=>'Haɗa manhajar AI','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Wannan buƙatar haɗin ta ƙare. Koma zuwa ƙa\'idar sannan ka sake fara haɗawa.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s yana neman amfani da %2$s a wannan rukunin yanar gizon a matsayin %3$s. Yana iya yin abin da aka ba asusunka na WordPress izinin yi kawai, kuma za ka iya cire haɗin a kowane lokaci daga saitunan wakilan AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ya bayyana kansa daga %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ya yi rajistar kansa kai tsaye. Ci gaba kawai idan kun fara wannan daga %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Asusunka ba zai iya amfani da waɗannan kayan aikin a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Bayan ka amsa za ka koma zuwa %s.','Allow %s'=>'Bada izinin %s','Do not allow'=>'Kada a ba da izini','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Wata ƙima da ake buƙata ta ɓace ko kuma ba ta da tsarin da ya dace. Bincika tsarin shigarwar (input schema) na damar.','The site refused the request.'=>'Shafin ya ƙi amincewa da buƙatar.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Bada damar mataimakan AI kamar Claude, Cursor ko VS Code su yi aiki a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon a madadin ku ta hanyar MCP (Model Context Protocol). Suna shiga a matsayin mai amfani da WordPress (Claude da ChatGPT ta hanyar amincewa da su a nan, wasu kuma da kalmar sirri ta manhaja) kuma za su iya yin abin da aka ba wannan mai amfani izinin yi kawai.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakilan AI suna buƙatar WordPress 6.9 ko kuma na gaba. Sabunta WordPress don amfani da su.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Adireshin haɗi (matsayar MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude da ChatGPT: shiga maimakon haka','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ƙara adireshin haɗin a matsayin mai haɗawa na musamman a cikin Claude, ko kuma a matsayin manhaja a yanayin mai haɓakawa na ChatGPT. Za su buɗe wannan rukunin yanar gizon domin ku amince da su; babu kalmar sirri da za a kwafa.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Manhajojin AI da aka haɗa da asusunka:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Sauran manhajojin AI: kalmar sirri ta manhaja','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ƙirƙiri kalmar sirri ta manhaja don mai amfani da kai','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ƙara wannan a cikin saitunan MCP na manhajar AI ɗinka, tare da sunan mai amfani da kuma wannan kalmar sirri:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: sanya wannan bayani a ƙarƙashin "servers" a cikin .vscode/mcp.json, ba a ƙarƙashin "mcpServers" ba.','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Kayan aikin da wakilin AI zai iya amfani da su a nan (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Jagorar mai amfani: Wakilan AI da MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Takardun masu haɓakawa: iyawa, REST da MCP','Check and purge this site\'s cache and change its cache settings with Zinn® Cache.'=>'Duba kuma share ma\'ajiyar sirri ta wannan shafi sannan ka canza saitunan ma\'ajiyar sirri tare da Zinn® Cache.','Page and object cache status, purging and settings.'=>'Matsayin ma\'ajiyar shafi da abubuwa, sharewa da saituna.','Read the cache status'=>'Karanta halin ma\'adanar bayanai ta cache','Returns whether the page cache and the object cache are on and working, how many pages are cached, and the object cache\'s connection and hit numbers.'=>'Yana mayar da ko ma\'ajiyar shafi da ma\'ajiyar abu suna kunne kuma suna aiki, yawan shafukan da aka ajiye a ma\'ajiya, da lambobin haɗin kai da na samun nasara na ma\'ajiyar abu.','Read the cache settings'=>'Karanta saitunan ma\'ajiya','Returns every cache setting. The Redis password is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Yana mayar da kowane saitin ma\'ajiya. Ba a taɓa mayar da kalmar sirri ta Redis ba, sai dai kawai ko an ajiye ɗaya.','Change the cache settings'=>'Sauya saitunan cache','Changes the settings you send and keeps the rest (page cache, how long pages stay cached, the object cache and its Redis connection, purging rules and exclusions). Values are checked and corrected exactly as on the Cache screen.'=>'Yana canza saitunan da kuka aika yana kuma riƙe sauran (ma\'ajiyar shafi ta cache, tsawon lokacin da shafuka ke zama a cache, ma\'ajiyar abubuwa ta cache da haɗin Redis dinta, ƙa\'idojin sharewa da keɓancewa). Ana duba ƙimomi kuma a gyara su daidai kamar yadda yake a allon Cache.','Put the cache settings back to their defaults'=>'Mayar da saitunan ma\'ajiya zuwa na asali','Puts every cache setting back to its default, as the Reset button does. The saved Redis password is removed too.'=>'Yana mayar da kowane saitin ma\'ajiyar cache zuwa na asali, kamar yadda madannin Sake saiti ke yi. Hakanan ana cire kalmar sirri ta Redis da aka ajiye.','Read the diagnostics report'=>'Karanta rahoton binciken matsala','Returns the diagnostics report support asks for: versions, server limits, the cache state and recent errors. It holds no passwords or keys.'=>'Yana dawo da rahoton binciken matsala da sashin taimako ke buƙata: nau\'o\'i, iyakokin uwar garken, yanayin cache da kuma kura-kuran kwanan nan. Ba ya ɗauke da kowace kalmar sirri ko maɓallai.','Purge the cache'=>'Share ma\'adanar ɓoye','Discards cached pages: everything (all: true), some addresses (urls) or everything tagged (tags). Pages are rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Yana watsar da shafukan da ke ajiye a cache: komai (all: true), wasu adiresoshin (urls) ko duk abin da aka yi wa alama (tags). Ana sake gina shafukan yayin da maziyarta ke shigowa.']];